// Preparation (DD-01 §3, delivery.md P13): the durable human-input records
// of a Preparation operation. Control persists question sets with their
// immutable absolute expiry, accepts one answer per question set revision
// under a durable command identity together with its Update relay intent,
// and freezes the brief that binds requirements, source revisions and
// brand/asset content digests to the preparation operation. The Workflow
// reads the accepted answer through GetAnswer (also for a lost Update
// receipt: the original answer and its Update are queried, never re-sent
// under a new identity); no Signal, polling loop or wake-up service exists.

